<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Taking a quick nap - ALMS</title>
<link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #F7F9FC; color: #002B5B; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }
  .box { max-width: 420px; }
  .icon { font-size: 56px; margin-bottom: 20px; animation: bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes bob { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-4deg); } 50% { transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(4deg); } }
  h1 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 800; }
  p { color: #64748B; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px; }
  .eta { font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  button { background: #FF5A5F; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
  button:hover { background: #E04B50; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="icon">😴</div>
    <h1>The database is taking a quick nap</h1>
    <p>Everything else is fine, just the database dozing off for a bit. Sadat's already been pinged and usually has it back up within a minute or two.</p>
    <p class="eta">This page checks again automatically every few seconds.</p>
    <button onclick="location.reload()"><i class="fas fa-rotate-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> Try again now</button>
  </div>
  <script>
    setTimeout(function () { location.reload(); }, 8000);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
